VidIMG does not bundle third-party programs or model weights. The setup command downloads them from their
official releases, each under its own license:
- Video2X 6.4.0 (AGPL-3.0), run as a separate program
- PyTorch, spandrel (BSD-3-Clause / MIT)
- open restoration models: BSRGAN/RealESRGAN family, SwinIR, SCUNet, NAFNet (BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0 / MIT,
  see tools/free-models/manifest.json)
- OpenCV Zoo YuNet and SFace face models (Apache-2.0)
- VapourSynth and its plugins, optional AviSynth+ plugins (each under its own open-source license; see
  tools/avisynth/manifest.json and tools/vapoursynth/lock.json)
- FFmpeg (LGPL / GPL, installed by the user through winget)
